658
00:43:45.540 --> 00:43:48.793
At siya ang naging pinakabatang nakatanggap ng
ang Korean Journalist of the Year award.

659
00:43:48.877 --> 00:43:51.463
Ang Korean Journalist of the Year award
papunta kay Ms. Wi Jeong-sin.

660
